          "content": "GENRE_ID: \"oss-dive\" 選択時のフォーム\npath hint: data/inputs/oss-dive/&lt;project-id&gt;",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rFS6E",
          "fill": "#64748b",
          "content": "oss-dive 固有フィールド:\n・REPO_ROOT_PATH: required\n・DEEP_DIVE_FOCUS: required（テキストエリア）\n・SOURCE_EXCLUDE_PATHS: optional\n・SOURCE_LANGUAGE_HINT: optional, default: mixed",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "aIuVU",
          "fill": "#64748b",
          "content": "共通フィールド: PROJECT_ID / STYLE_ID / CAST\n（AUDIENCE_* / BASELINE_CONTEXT / NOTES は省略表示）",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
